# Frontend Conventions

- Standalone components, signals where appropriate, strict TypeScript, lazy-loaded features.
- Do not duplicate PDF/OCR/image processing in the browser; call the FastAPI APIs.
- Feature folders: `upload`, `document-editor`, `document-viewer`, `text-editor`, `preview`, `export`, `conversation` (Phase 2).
- Shared models mirror the normalized document and edit-operation contracts from the backend.
- Keep UI responsive during OCR/export; show job status (`UPLOADING`, `PROCESSING`, `READY`, …).
